<description><![CDATA[<h3>What's new in Plugd 0.3.5</h3><ul><li>Bluetooth adapters: pair one in System Settings and Plugd finds it. This is new and not tested with a real adapter yet, so tell me how it goes.</li>
<li>If Plugd doesn't find your adapter, pick it in Settings &gt; Adapter.</li>
<li>Plugd now updates itself. When a new version is out, click Update and it installs and reopens.</li></ul>]]></description>
